{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "AWMC Gateway API",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "description": "AWMC 公共网关（对接 AWMC API v2）。\n\n- 对外仍使用明文 JSON；`keychip` 由网关注入，调用方不要传。\n- 扣费条件：HTTP 2xx 且上游业务成功（`/v1/health` 的 ping 为 `returnCode===0`，其它为 `returnCode===1`）。响应会双写兼容字段 `code===0`。\n- **高风险**：改门（`/v1/kaleidx-scope/upsert`）以及写入 `itemKind` 为 **4 / 8 / 15** 的收藏品，极可能对账号造成不可逆严重后果。"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.wmc.pub",
      "description": "Production"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "description": "连通检查"
    },
    {
      "name": "User",
      "description": "用户查询（只读）"
    },
    {
      "name": "Charge",
      "description": "Charge 购买与队列占位"
    },
    {
      "name": "Score",
      "description": "游戏内成绩写入 / 删除（传歌曲）"
    },
    {
      "name": "Item",
      "description": "道具与合并写入（含高风险种类）"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kaleidx",
      "description": "Kaleidx Scope（含改门高风险）"
    },
    {
      "name": "Upload",
      "description": "同步到落雪 / 水鱼"
    },
    {
      "name": "Usage",
      "description": "调用统计与失败率"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
