        "summary": "上游连通检查",
        "description": "消耗 0 Token。映射上游 `POST /ping`。成功时 `returnCode=0`、`returnMessage=pong`，并双写 `code=0`。",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Success"
          }
        }
      }
    },
