    "/v1/music/upsert": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Score"
        ],
        "summary": "上传 / 覆盖成绩（传歌曲）",
        "description": "消耗 **5 Token**。映射上游 `/upsert-music`。\n\n## musicList 长什么样？（直接复制改）\n\n整个请求体就是：`qrcode` + **`musicList` 数组**（长度 1～4）。数组里每一项是一条成绩对象。\n\n### 精确模式（推荐先看这个）：`fuzzy=false`，`dxScore` = 实际 DX 分\n\n```json\n{\n  \"qrcode\": \"SGWCMAID...\",\n  \"musicList\": [\n    {\n      \"musicId\": 11479,\n      \"level\": 3,\n      \"achievement\": 100.5,\n      \"dxScore\": 2100,\n      \"comboStatus\": \"ap\",\n      \"syncStatus\": \"fsd\",\n      \"fuzzy\": false\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### 一次传多条（最多 4 条）\n\n```json\n{\n  \"qrcode\": \"SGWCMAID...\",\n  \"musicList\": [\n    {\n      \"musicId\": 11479,\n      \"level\": 2,\n      \"achievement\": 100.5,\n      \"dxScore\": 2100,\n      \"comboStatus\": \"ap\",\n      \"syncStatus\": \"fsd\",\n      \"fuzzy\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"musicId\": 11479,\n      \"level\": 3,\n      \"achievement\": 99.75,\n      \"dxScore\": 2400,\n      \"comboStatus\": \"fc\",\n      \"syncStatus\": \"fs\",\n      \"fuzzy\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"musicId\": 11176,\n      \"level\": 2,\n      \"achievement\": 100.0,\n      \"dxScore\": 3,\n      \"comboStatus\": \"fcp\",\n      \"syncStatus\": \"fsp\",\n      \"fuzzy\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n上面第 3 条是**模糊模式**：`fuzzy=true` 时 `dxScore: 3` 表示 DX **星级 3**（约 93% 完成度），**不是** DX 分等于 3。\n\n### 数组每一项的字段\n\n| 字段 | 必填 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `musicId` | 是 | 曲目 ID（当前版本真实存在的；别名 `music_id` / `id`） |\n| `level` | 是 | `0` BASIC · `1` ADV · `2` EXP · `3` MAS · `4` Re:MAS · `10` 宴会场 |\n| `achievement` | 是 | 达成率，如 `100.5`（别名 `acc`） |\n| `dxScore` | 是 | `fuzzy=false`→实际 DX 分；`fuzzy=true`→星级 0～5 |\n| `comboStatus` | 建议 | `none` / `fc` / `fcp` / `ap` / `app`（或 0～4） |\n| `syncStatus` | 建议 | `none` / `fs` / `fsp` / `fsd`|`fdx` / `fsdp`|`fdxp` / `sync`（或 0～5） |\n| `fuzzy` | 建议 | `false` 精确 · `true` 模糊 |\n\n不要传 `keychip`（网关注入）。`musicId` 填错会返回上游 `5004`。\n\n成功：`returnCode===1`（响应也会双写 `code===0`）。\n",
        "security": [
          {
            "AWMCGatewayToken": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MusicUpsertRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "exact": {
                  "summary": "精确模式单条",
                  "value": {
                    "qrcode": "SGWCMAID...",
                    "musicList": [
                      {
                        "musicId": 11479,
                        "level": 3,
                        "achievement": 100.5,
                        "dxScore": 2100,
                        "comboStatus": "ap",
                        "syncStatus": "fsd",
                        "fuzzy": false
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "fuzzy": {
                  "summary": "模糊模式（dxScore=星级）",
                  "value": {
                    "qrcode": "SGWCMAID...",
                    "musicList": [
                      {
                        "musicId": 11176,
                        "level": 2,
                        "achievement": 100.0,
                        "dxScore": 3,
                        "comboStatus": "fcp",
                        "syncStatus": "fsp",
                        "fuzzy": true
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "multi": {
                  "summary": "一次最多四条",
                  "value": {
                    "qrcode": "SGWCMAID...",
                    "musicList": [
                      {
                        "musicId": 11479,
                        "level": 2,
                        "achievement": 100.5,
                        "dxScore": 2100,
                        "comboStatus": "ap",
                        "syncStatus": "fsd",
                        "fuzzy": false
                      },
                      {
                        "musicId": 11479,
                        "level": 3,
                        "achievement": 99.75,
                        "dxScore": 2400,
                        "comboStatus": "fc",
                        "syncStatus": "fs",
                        "fuzzy": false
                      },
                      {
                        "musicId": 11176,
                        "level": 2,
                        "achievement": 100.0,
                        "dxScore": 3,
                        "comboStatus": "fcp",
                        "syncStatus": "fsp",
                        "fuzzy": true
                      },
                      {
                        "musicId": 11176,
                        "level": 4,
                        "achievement": 98.5,
                        "dxScore": 1800,
                        "comboStatus": "none",
                        "syncStatus": "none",
                        "fuzzy": false
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Success"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InsufficientBalance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
